The Qlever platform is an entertainment and educational portal with cool games, logical tasks, and valuable prizes.
Use your ingenuity, erudition and critical thinking to not succumb to propaganda, cope with bullying or identify fake news.
A wide variety of games are collected here: adventures, simulators, runners, puzzles, role-playing games and more🚀
But the main thing is real prizes 🎁, which are easy to win by earning and exchanging points!
Register on the platform, become the best media expert and compete with other players! A sea of great experiences awaits you at Qlever! Learn new things every day, solve puzzles, win!🎮
✨Even more interesting facts:
- New games, quizzes and surveys are released regularly;
- If you like risk, put your points on the line in the Quizz game to compete with other players;
- Develop dexterity, attentiveness, observation, upgrade your knowledge and gain new ranks;
- Find a secret game, complete it and get a nice bonus ⭐
- Learn to identify propaganda, fake news, hate speech and how to respond to them;
- Read interesting and useful articles about the world of media;
- Make new friends among the players!
Keep your finger on the pulse to stay up to date with the latest news from Central Asia!
This platform was created with financial support from the European Union. Today, games are created with the support of the Bureau of Democracy, Human Rights and Labor of the US State Department. Its contents are the sole responsibility of the project partners (ERIM, Mediasabak, MediaNet, MJDC and Gurdofarid) and do not necessarily reflect the views of the donors.
The platform is available to citizens of Kazakhstan, Kyrgyzstan, Tajikistan and Uzbekistan.

