bluejetty:00129472:ios.description:
BabyBus Kids Math is a math game designed for kids. In this game, kids will explore the world of mathematics as they play a series of mini-games. They will enjoy learning math and eventually fall in love with it. Download BabyBus Kids Math and try it now!
LEARN
In BabyBus Kids Math, there're 6 levels of math knowledge with 100+ math facts, covering topics like number and shape recognition, counting, addition and subtraction, size comparison, sorting, matching, finding patterns, and more! It can meet the learning needs of kids of all ages!
PLAY
Besides the learning part, BabyBus Kids Math has also prepared a lot of math games for kids, such as puzzle and block games. The easy-to-play, fun and interactive math games help kids explore the world of mathematics and train their brains in a fun and engaging way.
APPLY
BabyBus Kids Math encourages kids to use their mathematical knowledge to solve real-life problems by providing various animations that simulate kids' daily life scenarios. It lets kids to think and observe on their own, and simulates their creativity!
FEATURES:
- 6 levels of math knowledge will be added gradually;
- A total of 100+ math facts;
- 4 core topics: number and quantity, graphs and space, logical relationships, measurement and operations;
- Improves kids' 7 major abilities: reasoning, concentration, number sense, calculation, transfer, observation and spatial imagination;
- Innovative math learning mode: Learn - Play - Apply;
- A wide range of math games to encourage kids to explore on their own;
- Simulates real-life scenarios to encourage kids to use math to solve real-world problems;
- Supports offline mode.

